Subject: [PATCH 08/14] media flags: HDR10+ flag and HDR type fallback

Adds the flags/videohdr/hdr10plus.png flag and makes VideoHDRType1Var
fall back to the library ListItem.HdrType when the HdrType.1 property is
empty, so HDR flags never render as an empty box. Touches Variables.xml.
---
 media/flags/videohdr/hdr10plus.png | Bin 0 -> 2215 bytes
 xml/Variables.xml                  |   6 +++++-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 media/flags/videohdr/hdr10plus.png

diff --git a/media/flags/videohdr/hdr10plus.png b/media/flags/videohdr/hdr10plus.png
new file mode 100644
